      "filename": "Aline Barnsdall Complex (9736565582).jpg",
      "title": "File:Aline Barnsdall Complex (9736565582).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/24/Aline_Barnsdall_Complex_%289736565582%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Aline_Barnsdall_Complex_(9736565582).jpg",
